<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">- Onobasulu</book>
  <para style="h">Aganebo Dimodi</para>
  <para style="rem">1st draft of Ch1, JH &amp; YM,Ukarumpa, March 2010, Ch2-4 whole team in WLG.</para>
  <para style="rem">2nd draft, WF &amp; JW in Ukarumpa, March 2011</para>
  <para style="toc1">Folohe Dimodifea Sowi Aganebo Ewe Selefia Mebailu</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Dimodi</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Dim</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Dimodi</para>
  <para style="mt2">Folohe Dimodifea</para>
  <para style="mt2">Sowi Aganebo Ewe Selefia Mebailu</para>
  <para style="imt">Sulu samini alegaeyo</para>
  <para style="ip">Folo e dibolo moloa sigiamo, e olaeyomo hagoale adefeba asigisiamo, sowi ewe Dimodifea ami seleba mebailu. Sowi selelu usu amimo, sulu noolo dobu. Sulu nomo, higinilu nonoba holobagasimo, Dimodi e Yesu Kelisodai dafifia ligia, ene asigi ule ufulumo, kolelu melesifia, ami haguguba efea seleba melu. Sulu nomo ewe. Dimodi e Yesune sulu manamo nafuluba kiwigaaba walelabia daaba melesi, sulu ami seleba melu. Aufia, sulu nomo, ewe. Dimodi ehe Yesu Keliso heneba homesi, dabalu kiwigaaba molomesi seleba melu. Aufia, Folo e dibolo molo usu sigiamo, noolo e gadefia dedalesimo, e hafinilu asulugulu, Dimodihe e babiyo milesi, sowi efea ami seleba mebailu.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Separator Artwork for the Onobasulu NT - Waves" file="Separator1Onobasulu.tiff" size="span" loc="Between Book entry and text of the NT" copy="Johann Alberts, based on Onobasulu artwork" ref="1.0" /></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1" />Na <char style="w">Folo</char>. <char style="w">Keliso</char> Yesune <char style="w">hilibaisi daalu inolo</char> uleno, na. Godene hame alefasia, Ehe na Ene dabalu molomesi iminifia hilibailu. Keliso Yesufea alefasia, miliyolu miliyo diyobafeba saaba ufulu amone, idele inolofea saaba memesi, Ehe na gadefalu. Nahe,<verse eid="2TI 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 16:1">HD 16.1</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 1:2">1Dim 1.2</ref></char>
    </note>Sowi ewe, Dimodi gafea seleba mebaisu. Ga koleba, ne hameselu faibe koleba labe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2TI 1:2" />
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 1:2">Nine Nao Gode alefasiada, Keliso Yesu nine <char style="w">Saminilo</char> alefasiada, <char style="w" lemma="Kanululo">kanululoda</char>, yagunagaloda, <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">aeaba ofoloda</char> gafea melesi moloyobafe.<verse eid="2TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Awalu sulu nafulufealomo, nini yuaeyobale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 23:1">HD 23.1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ne nauwadalihe, <char style="w" lemma="Asigi nafulune si">asigine si</char> enaeda ligia, Godene dabalu mololugulu, nada amogubasu moloba lolu. Aulugulu, nigilibada, yaidada, na koleba <char style="w" lemma="Godedai sulu selefe">Godedai sulu selesiamo</char>, ga asigi gagabasu ligia, Efea henelu sulu selabasu ado. <verse eid="2TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4" />Ge si hano sugalu amone obegeba hilisesiamo, na henelo wasigamesi na ga babaiyeba hamefe.<verse eid="2TI 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5-6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.5-6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 16:1">HD 16.1</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 4:14">1Dim 4.14</ref></char>
    </note>Samini ge gafiye Loisidai, ge gae Yunisidai, aaluhe <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> amoguba, gada Kelisofea asigi ule koleba dobuba, na auba hilisefe. Aufia, nahe ge asigi ule ufulu kolelu amone hilisesiamo, nahe ge asigi eweguba degeba ufiyo hamefe. Godene ulu kegele, ne sone ge gunia ofelesi, gafea melu ogomo, ge miliyolu aleba ugi de waiyamesine ga fuumale. <verse eid="2TI 1:5-6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:15">Lom 8.15</ref></char></note>Asubane, Godehe ninifea melu amo, bubulilo asubaneale. Aubale. Asubane amomo, kiwigagaloda, hameseloda, nine miliyolu nafuluba isoba adoda, amone labe.<verse eid="2TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8" />Aulugulu, gahe nine Saminilone sulu ulufaba saaba meyomo, yuamabiyo. Aufia, na Efea alefasia dibolo inolo lolu ewene baaba, ga yuamabiyo. Auluso, awalu sulu nafulune na naga disu ewene, ga-da nadai gegoamale. Godehe gafea auba molomesi kiwi meyobafe.<verse eid="2TI 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 2:8-9">Efe 2.8-9</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 3:5">Dai 3.5</ref></char>
    </note>Godehe nini obegeba <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba difasia</char>, nine miliyolu <char style="w" lemma="Muuba kalilu">muuba kalilu noekene</char> melesine welu. Nine mana mololu amone baafia, Ehe nini weluale. Aubale. Ene <char style="w">kanululo</char> alefasia, nini auba muuba kalilu melesine weyoba daiyalu. Ene kanululo ewe, kegele sunia aso moloba holobagaeyo labi, Keliso Yesufea alefasia, Ehe amo ninifea meyoba daiyalu. <verse eid="2TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 2:14">Hib 2.14</ref></char></note>Aufia, fogo aga yagi Godene kanululo mana amo ulufaba holobagalu. Nine <char style="w">Gasiba Dafelagoba Dilo</char>, Keliso Yesu, E ulufaba holobagafefea alefasia holobagalu. E alefasia, olalone kiwimo woba dafelesi, asigilelu. Aufia, Ene awalu sulu nafulu amo alefasia, olalale miliyo amofea yane neeba dowelu. <verse eid="2TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 2:7">1Dim 2.7</ref></char></note>Godehe na Ene sulu weba ado inolo melesida, <char style="w">hilibaisi daalu inolo</char> melesida, walelo inolo melesida, amone iminifia na gadefalu. <verse eid="2TI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12" />Aufia, mau amo alefasia, na aga naga ewe diaba yaasu. Auluso, na yuasuale maumo, Abefea nada <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufulumo</char>, E amobamo, na asigibu. Aulune, na kiwigaaba eweguba asigibu. Gode E alefasia, dabalu ne sone saabia ufulu amo, nafuluba yasifia luba adabia abia, aleba eloyo hilia holobagasi, eloyobafe.<verse eid="2TI 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13" />Sulu haidelelu na gafea saaba melu amo, dubulu aubasu imini kuliba abia, gahe idele inolofea walemale. Auba walesiamo, ga asigi ule ofoloda, hameseloda, Keliso Yesu Efea alefasia saabe amonedai, walemale. <verse eid="2TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 6:20">1Dim 6.20</ref></char></note>Daalo ge sone saabia ama diba ofogolu amo, ga nafuluba yasifia luba melale. <char style="w">Asubane Noekene</char> ninifea labe ewehe, ga auba luba melesine, sagoba ufiyobafe.<verse eid="2TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15" />Ga hilisebu, Asia hele bule ami alebaibumo inolo nadai dabalu ua mololo ilimo, sunia na gadefia dedalefia labe. Aufia, Figelusudai, Hemogenesedai, aaluda, na gadefia dedalefia labe.<verse eid="2TI 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16" />Auluso, Saminilohe Onesifolusufeada, ene damenefeada, yagunagasia ediliba ufiyobafe, maumo, fogo wedinale ehe na haiba asigi degeba ofeleso. Aufia, na dibolo labimo, e yuasale. <verse eid="2TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17" />Aubale. E inigia, Lome goasiamo, e hogoloba isalabia siba labeofia, na besabi afeleso. <verse eid="2TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18" />Aleba eloyo hilia adefeiyamo, Saminilohe e yagunagamesifia, na Godedai sulu selesu. Ga asigisia, Efesa dauno ami, Onesifolusu e dabalu wedinale molosia, na sagoba ofelesoba asigibu.<verse eid="2TI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2" />
  <para style="s">Dimodi e Keliso Yesune yobolo inolo nafulu miliyo dobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1" />Ne faibe, gafea na eweguba selesu. <char style="w">Kanululo</char> Keliso Yesufea saabe amofea alefasia, kiwigaafia melale. <verse eid="2TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2" />Aufia, sulu sunia, na idele inolo wedinalene si saabia selesi, ga dubulu amone, suluda saidafolale inolo ine sone saabia homale. Ili amo idele inolo noolofeada waleyone dawalolo dulu miliyo dobu.<verse eid="2TI 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2TI 1:8">2Dim 1.8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ga koleba, <char style="w">Keliso</char> Yesune yobolo inolo nafulu ligia, nini noolo dabalu ewene higinilu sefe amo galiba ua semale. <verse eid="2TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4" />Yobolo inolo ine manamo, ga hilisebu. Yobolo dabalu molosiamo, ilihe ine asigi kegele nofea haiba ofolale. Aubale. Ine yasilohe dabalu ili molofemo henemesifia, yoboyo dabalu amosu nafuluba mololo.<verse eid="2TI 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2TI 4:8">2Dim 4.8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, inolohe kaamo melesine naguba aafe amo, e koleba, naguba ano amone muguli sunia kuliba maiyo dobu. Auba kuliba aasalenaga, kaamo adesiale, elebe dife amodai diyobafale.<verse eid="2TI 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 9:7">1Kld 9.7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, inolohe edo geiya dabalu bule hogoloba molofe e-mo, sebe sufia diba dobi, edale ene osolaba ufulumone sebe dilo. <verse eid="2TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7" />Ga koleba sulu na solu amo, nafuluba asigi gagaba melale. Ausi, <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilohe</char> ge asigi ogofea sawaba ofelesi, gahe sulu ewene kiwi suniamo nafuluba fadaba asigiyobafe.<verse eid="2TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 15:4">1Kld 15.4</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 1:3">Lom 1.3</ref></char>
    </note>Hilia sunia, ga koleba, Yesu Keliso hilisebasu melale. E kini <char style="w" lemma="Deibidi">Deibidine</char> mosomu inolo ligia, olafia degelu inolo amo E. Awalu sulu amone, na walesu. <verse eid="2TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 3:1">Efe 3.1</ref>, <ref loc="EPH 3:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 1:12-14">Fil 1.12-14</ref></char></note>Awalu sulu nafulu ewe na selesumo, mau amo alefasia, inolo noolo ilihe na inolo wolugulu baafia, higinilu nokene nokeneba nafea mesia, na seini dofafia, dibolo dafogobu. Auluso, Godene sulu manamo, ulenohe seini dofafia, dibolo dafogoyodoluale koleba. <verse eid="2TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10" />Amo alefasia, ne libo kiwigaaba ofelesi, higinilu amo sunia waagulu boloba, na disu. Nahe Gode Ene molobebelelu idele inolo amo sagoba ofaiyesia, higinilu auba disu. Ilida, Keliso Yesufea alefasia, <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba</char> difasia, Godene <char style="w">elalelu</char> usu <char style="w">miliyolu miliyo</char> dimalebaiyeba asigisu.<verse eid="2TI 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 4:11">2Kld 4.11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sulu seale ewe sigiba doma.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2TI 2:11" />
  <para style="li1" vid="2TI 2:11">Ninida Edai olalunaga,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2TI 2:11">amo nini Edai bebea miliyobafe.<verse eid="2TI 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:33">Mad 10.33</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Higinilu disia nini waagulu boloba kalugasenaga,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2TI 2:12">amo E yasiba labea ami, nini Edai ua luba miliyobafe.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2TI 2:12">Auluso, nini Efea faiso mesenaga,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2TI 2:12">amo Ehe aubasu ninifea faiso meyobafe.<verse eid="2TI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 3:3-4">Lom 3.3-4</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 1:2">Dai 1.2</ref></char>
    </note>Ninihe Edai miliyoba saaba ofa solumo molosalenaga,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2TI 2:13">amo Ehe ninidai miliyoba sulu saaba ofa solumo aso mololabia daabasu miliyobafe. Enebamo, Ehe Ene sulu dedegelale koleba.<verse eid="2TI 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Godene dabalu mololohe Gode henemesi moloyo dobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TI 6:4">1Dim 6.4</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 3:9">Dai 3.9</ref></char>
    </note>Hilia sunia, ga koleba, sulu ewe selabasu ligia, idele inolofea asigiba ofolabasu melale. Aufia, Godene si saabiamo, ga ilifea eweguba haguguba saamale. “Sulu kiwi amone saeyone hegemabiyo.” Enebamo, auba hegefemo eleda male. Aubale. Hegelu sulu amohe dobelefe ilimo, woba dafalilo.<verse eid="2TI 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TI 4:6">1Dim 4.6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gene koleba kiwigaafia, dabalu mololo nafulu koleba holobagaeyo molosi, Godehe ge dabalu molofe bisigia, E gafea heneyobafe. Auba ausi, ga koleba, Godene sulu seale sodo isoba sefia ligia, Ene si saabia yuaeyodoluale. <verse eid="2TI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 4:7">1Dim 4.7</ref></char></note>Godene asigi kuliba abiale sulu balu agogolo ili amofea, faiso memale. Enebamo, sulu amoguluda saeyo nenalebalusu adefe ilimo, Godefea faiso mesia, hago hagoba maiyolu maiyobafe.<verse eid="2TI 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17-18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.17-18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TI 1:20">1Dim 1.20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sulu amogulumo, aiye wagegeme inoloda woba ofolo amogulu adesia, bulelabia abia buleyobafe. Sulu amoguluda sodo ili aleba amimo, Himenesudai, Filedusudai, aaluhe sulu auba selaba ligia, seale sodo eno afasia, babeaba daalu. Mau enebamo, aaluhe eweguba sodo. “Nini ama olafia, aga degelu lolu. Aulune, nini dufia haiba saabia degeyaleba” sodo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.17-18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dawalolo inolo hilisesia, inolo aida amohe, hano gelufealomo olalu degeloba sodo. Aulugulu, domalafealomo, dufia saabia haiba degeyobafaleba solububa hiliselu.</char></note> Aalu sulu auba selefe amohe, idele inolo noolone <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufulumo</char> woba waalefe.<verse eid="2TI 2:17-18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 16:5">Nam 16.5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:14">Yon 10.14</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 8:3">1Kld 8.3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 52:11">Ais 52.11</ref></char>
    </note>Auluso, Godehe Ene sese molo dulu amone, ikau kolelu gelu dobu amo, kiwigaaba kalugaafia labe. Mau enebamo, Godehe enaosia iminiba ofelesia, ikau amofeamo sulu eweguba selelu dobu. <char style="sc">Saminilohe Ene idele inolomo Ene fadaba asigibu.</char></para>
  <para style="m" vid="2TI 2:19">Aufia, sulu eweda ikau amofea selelu dobu. <char style="sc">Sunia abehe Saminilone wi fogaba saaba dafelagofemo, ilihe wolu moloyofealo faiso meyo dobu. </char><verse eid="2TI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20" />Elebeda ufulu inolo amone molo bulemo, golodai silifadai mololu kegele amosu waalebuale. Aubale. Idai, heledai mololu gofoda, fofoda, kegele amoda waalebu. Aufia, maugaba kegele lagomo, dabalu nafulu nokene mololo. Aufia, salu ilogomo, dabalu balu nugumada mololo. <verse eid="2TI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21" />Aulugulu, inolo ulenohe nuguma ene miliyolufea dobumo heeba dafelesenaga, e Godene si saabia galagololu holobagasia, e-mo dabalu nafulu nokene moloyone gofogulu holobagaeyobafe. Amo e-mo, dabalu nafulu sunia moloyomo madenefia ligia, ene biso sagoba ufiyodolu miliyobafe. <figure style="fig" alt="Various vessels" file="HK00143B.TIF" size="col" copy="Horace Knowles © The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1954, 1967, 1972, 1995." ref="2.20-21">Gofodai, disidai nonoba ami waalebu.</figure><verse eid="2TI 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TI 6:11">1Dim 6.11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, ga koleba, fisamili ine wolu molobaiyelofealo fisaba abia, isolu manada, asigi ule ufuluda, hameseloda, <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">aealoda</char>, amofealo migagaba malale. Gada libo galagololu ligia, Godedai sulu selaba ado inolo noolo galiba, ua auba migagaba moloba melale. <verse eid="2TI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 4:7">1Dim 4.7</ref></char></note>Aufia, gahe asigida male kagoalu sulu hegeba selaba adefe ili amofea, koneni kimabiyo. Enebamo, ga hilisebu, sulu amogulumo, gadisia belaguyo degeba ofolo. <verse eid="2TI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24" />Auluso, Saminilone dabalu mololo e-mo, gadiba belaguyodoluale dobu. Aubale. Ehe gadilo sebale ligia, inolo suniafea onafia ligia, waleyone dawalolo dulu miliyo dobu. <verse eid="2TI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25" />Aufia, elelilu inolo noolohe ene sulu saidafelesenaga, ehe onafia ligia, ine asigimo isoyo dobu. Godehe inolo amogulu <char style="w" lemma="Asigi besiyo">asigi besimesisia</char>, sagoba ufiyobafeba hilisesia, ga koleba, ili auba isomale. Ausi, ili amo sulu seale sodo ewefea asigilo nafulu diyobafe. <verse eid="2TI 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26" /><char style="w" lemma="Henane">Henanehe</char> ilimo ene sulu kuliba malesifia, koo waleba ufulu dobu. Auluso, ili ine asigimo haiba nafuluba sawasiamo, koo waloiya amifia fisaba daafia, sububa dafogolu miliyobafe.<verse eid="2TI 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3" />
  <para style="s">Aleba eloyo hilia hagoale adesimo, idele inolo mana wolusu moloyobafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TI 4:1">1Dim 4.1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auluso, ga koleba, ewene eloba bamale. Aleba eloyo hilia hagoale adesimo, fogo wolu koleba holobagaeyobafe. <verse eid="2TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2" />Maumo, fogo amoyamo idele inolo eweguba moloba miliyobafe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2TI 3:2" />
  <para style="li" vid="2TI 3:2">Ili ine meleba hameseyobafe.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="2TI 3:2">Ili mole hameseyobafe.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="2TI 3:2">Ili ine meleba wi digiba yaeyobafe.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="2TI 3:2">Ili bamabamaba yaeyobafe.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="2TI 3:2">Ilihe Godene wi gaidaboba saaba yaeyobafe.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="2TI 3:2">Ilihe enaedai enaodaine sulu saidafiyobafe.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="2TI 3:2">Ilihe idele inolo mana nafuluda moloba ofelefe ili amofea henelu sulu saeyobafale.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="2TI 3:2">Ilimo Godedai <char style="w" lemma="Muuba kalilu">muuba kaliluale</char> adaaba yaeyobafe.<verse eid="2TI 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3" />Ilihe hameselale adaaba yaeyobafe.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="2TI 3:3">Ilihe none wolu hamasia heesia galilale adaaba yaeyobafe.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="2TI 3:3">Ilihe noolofea sulu wolu diba meba yaeyobafe.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="2TI 3:3">Ilihe ine domalane hame yasifia luba miliyobafale.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="2TI 3:3">Ilihe nofea naga meyomo henefia, yagu nagabale ligia, meba yaeyobafe.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="2TI 3:3">Ilimo mana nafulufeamo gisa adaaba yaeyobafe.<verse eid="2TI 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4" />Ilihe holonolo adaaba yaeyobafe.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="2TI 3:4">Ilihe dabagalalo adaaba yaeyobafe.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="2TI 3:4">Ili elelisia, buleba hiliselo adaaba yaeyobafe.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="2TI 3:4">Ili ine meleba heneba ufiyone hamesia, Gode hameseyobafale.<verse eid="2TI 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 7:15">Mad 7.15</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 7:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 1:16">Dai 1.16</ref></char>
    </note>Ilihe Godene manamo domala balusu kuliba abia, ilihe amone kiwi seale nafuluba hiliseyobafale.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2TI 3:5" />
  <para style="m" vid="2TI 3:5">Inolo amogulu baabamo ga koleba, hago melale. <verse eid="2TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6" />Maumo, inolo ewegulu ili amohe, asigida sanelu labe idele gegefia, ine molo usu faseba sugalo. Aufia, ilihe ili hahanosia, ine asigi luba ado. Idele amogulu ilihe, <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> wedinale molosi, woba mololumone higiniluhe ili dufa dafogolo. Aufia, wolu nokene nokeneba molobaiyeba hamelo amohe, ili lubia aasi, babeaba dedalefe. <verse eid="2TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7" />Idele ili amo dawalolo diabasu miliyo hamelo. Auluso, ili amo Godene sulu sealemo eloba bolale.<verse eid="2TI 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 7:11">Kis 7.11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Samini, Yanesedai, Yamebesedai, aalumo, <char style="w" lemma="Mosese">Mosesedai</char> gisa alolu. Mana aubasu kuliba abia, inolo lagi solu ili amohe, seale sulu sododai gisa adefe. Ine asigimo, gali kalemolugulu dobune, ili <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufulufealomo</char> hodobailu dobu. <verse eid="2TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9" />Ine dabalu molofemo fogo selale maiyobafale. Enebamo, idele inolo suniahe, ili heleba molofebuba fadaba babiyobafe. Samini, Yanesedai, Yamebesedai, heleba molosi abulu, auba babiyobafe.<verse eid="2TI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dimodihe Godene sulu mana fedoba seyo dobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10" />Auluso Dimodi, ga-mo nadai alolune, ne manamo, ga sunia asigibu. Ne walelo manada, ne miliyolu siba ado manada, ne iminiba ano manada, ne <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> manada, ne hamedufulu manada, ne hameseloda, higinilu holobagasi waagulu boloba ado mana amoda, mana amo sunia na moloba adomo, ga asigibu. <verse eid="2TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:14-52">HD 13.14-52</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:5">14.5</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 14:8-20">8-20</ref></char></note>Aufia, Adiogoda, Aikoniamada, Lisidolada, dauno ami idele inolohe, nafea mana wolu molosi, naga na dulumoda, kegele sunia nafea ami holobagalumoda, ga asigibu. Auluso, higinilu sunia amofeafia <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilohe</char> na sububa dafelagoso. <verse eid="2TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:24">Mad 16.24</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:20">Yon 15.20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:22">HD 14.22</ref></char></note>Seale koleba, idele inolo sunia Keliso Yesudai kulifia ligia, Godene mana kuliba maiyo hamefe ili amofea, inolo noolohe woba ufiyone mi kuliyobafe. <verse eid="2TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13" />Ausi, wolu inoloda, gegelo inoloda, ili wolune wolu koleba adabia abia maiyobafe. Aufia, ilihe noolomo gegebasu labi, noolohe ili gegeyobafe.<verse eid="2TI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14" />Auluso, sulu ga sigidofasia asigi ule ufulu amo, gahe kiwigaafia fedoba semale. Enebamo, idele inolo gada walelumo, ili amobamo, gene ga nafuluba asigibu. <verse eid="2TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15" />Aufia, ge gaehe ga naiyo agaaba meiya amifia adabia inigia, aga iwimo, ga Godene sulu selelumo fadaba asigifia labe. Bugo ewehe gafea isoba asigi nafulu mesi, gahe Keliso Yesufea asigi ule ofelesi, Godehe ga <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba</char> diyobafe.<verse eid="2TI 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 15:4">Lom 15.4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Godene sulu selelu dobumo sunia, Godene Asubane alefasia asigiba ofelesi, selelu. Aulune, waleyoneda, isosia kolelu saeyoneda, asigi isoluale isoyoneda, nini isolu melesi moloba waleyoneda, auba moloyone, Godene sulu selelumo, kegele nafulu koleba dobu. <verse eid="2TI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17" />Aulugulu, Godene dabalu mololo ili amohe bugo ewe sefia elenaga, dabalu nafulu sunia moloyone kegele selu miliyobafe koleba. <figure style="fig" alt="Teaching children" file="05_De_11_03_RG_gr.tif" size="col" copy="© Sweet Publishing http://sweetpublishing.com, licensed under a CC: BY-SA 3.0 Unported licence." ref="3.14-15">Dimodi faibe wedino waagifia, e Godene sulu asigifia alolu.</figure><verse eid="2TI 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4" />
  <para style="s">Dimodi e koleba Godene sulu mana kiwigaaba waleyo dobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1" />
    <char style="w">Keliso</char> Yesu kini alefasia, yasiba miliyone ulufaba holobagasiamo, Ehe bebea kakainabu eweda, daneba yaalu amoda, osolaeyobafe. Aulugulu, Godedai, Keliso Yesudai, Aine si saabia na gafea eweguba kiwigaaba selesu. <verse eid="2TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2" />Ga koleba, Godene sulu mana walemale. Fogo dobiada, fogo maleiyada, ga eweguba mololabia maiyone, madenefia melale. Ga hamedufulu ligia, walelo mana nafuludai, idele inolo isomale. Aufia, ili isosia kiwigaaba saamale. Aufia, ine asigi degeba ofa walemale.<verse eid="2TI 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TI 4:1">1Dim 4.1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Bama. Dufiamo, idele inolohe sulu haidelelu dubiyo hameyobafale. Aubale. Ine konenimo, sulu nokene nokeneba selefe amone dubiyone gogagogaeyobafe. Aulune, ilihe masega walelo wedinale molafia, sulu ili dobaiyeba hamefe amogulu walemesi molalo. <verse eid="2TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4" />Ausi, ili seale sulu sodofea faiso mesia, sadalu balu nokene nokeneba selefemofea ine koneni kiyobafe. <verse eid="2TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5" />Auluso, gene ga kolebamo, hilia sunia ge asigi sawafia ligia, gene meleba nafuluba luba melale. Aufia, higinilu waagulu boloba dimale. Gahe awalu sulu nafulu waleyo amone dabalu molomale. Aufia, ga dabalu sunia samodoyoba molomale.<verse eid="2TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folo e olaeyo hagoalefe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PHP 2:17">Fil 2.17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ga asigibu, ne miliyolumo waini hano Godefea ulu mesia sagalu amoguba, sagaba ufulu dobu. Aulune, na maiyo hiliamo, hagoalefe. <verse eid="2TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 6:12">1Dim 6.12</ref></char></note><char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">Asigi ule ufulumone</char> belagulo nafulumo, na belagulu lolu. Naguba ano amo na imini iminiba naguba daafasia, eloa goalu lolu. Auba ausiane, asigi ule ufulumo na aso fedoba sefia lolu. <verse eid="2TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:24-25">1Kld 9.24-25</ref></char></note>Auba sefia lolune, agamo na sunialune elebegulu habuga, na dimesine madenelu dobu. Hilia amo adesi, <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilohe</char> habuga amo nafea mesiamo, na isolu inoloba iminisia, saligaba ufiyobafe. Isoba Osolalo Saminilo Ehe, habuga elebegulu mesia, ule nafeasu meyobafale. Aubale. Idele inolo E ulufaba holobagamesi babaiyeba hamesia yasifia alebaibu ili amo suniafeada meyobafe.<verse eid="2TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dimodi koleba Folo labea alebale miyo dobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9" />Ga koleba, na labea miyone eno alebale isamale. <verse eid="2TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 8:23">2Kld 8.23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">HD 15.37-39</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:14">Kol 4.14</ref></char></note>Demase, e helefealune mana hamesia, na gadefia abia, Desalonaika dauno ami aaso. Kelesene, e hele bule Galasia ami afa aasi, <char style="w" lemma="Daidasa">Daidasa</char>, e Dalamadia disiligi ami aaso. <verse eid="2TI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11" /><char style="w" lemma="Lugu">Lugu</char> elebisu nadai labe. Aulugulu, gahe <char style="w" lemma="Maga">Maga</char> luba difasia, gadai milamale. Maumo, e ne dabalu sagoyomo inolo nafulu koleba. <verse eid="2TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12" />Digikusu e-mo, nahe Efesa ami hilibailu. <verse eid="2TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:6">HD 20.6</ref></char></note>Ga inigiamo, ne badisi saligalo selale na Dolase dauno ami Kafusune moloa gadefia mulu dobu amo, diba semale. Aufia, bugo homogoluda semale. Amo sesiamo, nafuluba koleba, kelebulu bado mololu bugo amo galimabiyo.<verse eid="2TI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 59:18">Ais 59.18</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:6">Lom 2.6</ref></char>
    </note>Aeyene dabalu mololo inolo Alegesada amohe, e nafea wolu koleba mololu. Dufia, Saminilohe mana e mololu amone sabe moloba obegeyobafe. <verse eid="2TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15" />Aulugulu, gada inolo ogo baaba enogele ligia yasimale, maumo, ehe nine sulufeamo gisa ligia, kiwigaaba moloba alolu.<verse eid="2TI 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16" />Maugaba nadai fadaasiamo, na nene meleba subuyo sulu saeyone fogo iminilu adesi, inolo uleno na sagoba ufiyo saabeale. Aubale. Inolo sunia na gadefia dedaleso. Ine auba heleba moloba yaalu amo, Godehe ilifea sabe meba obegemesiale, nahe Edai sulu selesu. <verse eid="2TI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17" />Auluso, fogo ami, Saminilo E-mo na aniba yoba ligia, nafea kiwi meba adeso. Na alefasia, awalu sulu nafuluba walesihe, <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau idele inolo</char> isoba domesine, E auba moloso. Ausi, na <char style="w" lemma="Laeono">laeonone</char> mofe sugaluso, Godehe na gasiba diso. <verse eid="2TI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18" />Aubasu, mana wolu sunia na saguba gaasi, Saminilohe na gasiba diyobafe. Aufia, na nafulu melesi moloba ofelesia, Ene Ehe na lubia, <char style="w">hebene</char> Saminilo ligia yasifia ada ami maiyobafe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2TI 4:18" />
  <para style="qc" vid="2TI 4:18">
    <char style="w" lemma="Elalelu">Elalelumo,</char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="2TI 4:18">Efea alefalu alefaeyobafe.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="2TI 4:18">
    <char style="sls">
      <char style="w">Amen</char>.</char> Amo seale koleba.<verse eid="2TI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 18:2">HD 18.2</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 1:16-17">2Dim 1.16-17</ref></char>
    </note>Ga koleba Fulisiladai, Akiwiladaifeada, Onesifolusune damenedalifeada, hawiyoba selesoba saamale. <verse eid="2TI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:22">HD 19.22</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 20:4">20.4</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 16:23">Lom 16.23</ref></char></note>Elasadusu e aso Kolidi sidi ami labe. Aufia, Dolofimusu e walefasi, nahe e Miledusu dauno ami gadefafia mulu. <verse eid="2TI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21" />Ga koleba kene gi aso holobagabale labi, ga alebale miyone eno isamale. Yubulusuda, Fudeneseda, Linusuda, Kolodiada, ilida, ge sigidubulu damenedali suniada, gafea hawiyoba selefe.<verse eid="2TI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22" />Saminilo E ge asubane ogodai miliyobafe. Aufia, Godene <char style="w" lemma="Kanululo">kanululomo</char> gili suniafea miliyobafe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:22">
    <figure style="fig" alt="End of book bilas" file="EndOfBookOnobasulu_Epistles.tiff" size="span" loc="End of Book" ref="4.22" /><verse eid="2TI 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4" />
</usx>